egory_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"_LgI5387qAmMuS8i6h69cg","review_id":"7CxRQ_lOfiiSfRVydZDtPA","date":"2018-02-04T01:12:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9409946203231812,"text_excerpt":"First time at Meril tonight. I was very impressed with the style, the restaurant, the good vibes, the great service and the food was good. Didn't get to try much but the steak was great and the crawfish bread was delicious. The LA PALOMA drink is a must try and the king cake tres leches dessert was the bomb. Some portions were small though and I'm a big eater."},{"business_id":"_LgI5387qAmMuS8i6h69cg","review_id":"wRUnHtV8D6FjUIY5Y6Uk3w","date":"2018-10-30T20:33:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9383220076560974,"text_excerpt":"I went to Meril for dinner based on the recommendations of a friend. The experience was quite good. I would definitely go back, and highly recommend this place to others. First of all, when I arrived, I was offered the option of either a table or sitting at the chef's bar. Since it was just me, I opted for the chef's bar so I could watch the activity in the kitchen. I'm glad I did so because the kitchen was quite lively and fun to watch. The waitress was quite attentive and fun to talk to. I started with an order of deviled eggs. I love deviled eggs when they are done well, and the waitress ensured me that I would love these. She was absolutely correct! The shrimp and cajun caviar combine..."},{"business_id":"_LgI5387qAmMuS8i6h69cg","review_id":"ffgcbwlPHKWB7c2KOBJOaw","date":"2019-11-04T20:31:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9378855228424072,"text_excerpt":"I was pretty impressed with Meril - in general the food was really good, and a good value besides. I had dinner with a group of 8, and thought they handled a larger party well despite being packed with other larger groups. We had a reservation but still had to wait close up 30 minutes which wasn't great. I did like their wine list - lots to pick from including one of my favorite Cremants, St Hilaire. The bartender overcharged me though ($15 vs the $14 menu price) and I didn't realize it til later. Sad face. We started with a bunch of things: deviled eggs (yum), cornbread, shrimp tacos and fried biscuits - all excellent except for the biscuit things which ended up like hush puppies, kind o..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_LgI5387qAmMuS8i6h69cg","photo_id":"4IQSYUf6W-HkC50nW_PpLg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/4IQSYUf6W-HkC50nW_PpLg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8451550006866455},{"business_id":"_LgI5387qAmMuS8i6h69cg","photo_id":"kPQvj2jcN2q34u6T-uVnrQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kPQvj2jcN2q34u6T-uVnrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8354099988937378},{"business_id":"_LgI5387qAmMuS8i6h69cg","photo_id":"ezMTaOo3CBL6wSa42kycoA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ezMTaOo3CBL6wSa42kycoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8064764738082886},{"business_id":"_LgI5387qAmMuS8i6h69cg","photo_id":"JsRga3ADvb3nPrGrerDDrQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JsRga3ADvb3nPrGrerDDrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7939544320106506},{"business_id":"_LgI5387qAmMuS8i6h69cg","photo_id":"uu0GEPKD34DEHROEhaoNOg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uu0GEPKD34DEHROEhaoNOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7844586372375488}]},"notebook_case":null}
